  "sudokuConflictGuideTitle": "PRO+ Conflict Check Mode",
  "sudokuConflictGuideBody": "• Chill – High (Levels 1–4): Digits are checked immediately against the solution key. Any wrong entry costs 1 life, and correct cells lock.\n• PRO – God (Levels 5–7): The hidden solution is not spoiled, so you can test and change guesses freely.\n• How Lives Decrease in PRO+: Placing a duplicate conflict in the same row, column, or 3×3 box costs 1 life (PRO: 3, Nightmare: 2, God: 1 Sudden Death).\n• Win / Lose: Running out of lives ends the game. Completing all 81 cells with zero conflicts wins.",

