  "chessInfoSummaryVsAi": "Ranked • ELO vs AI & Leaderboard",
  "chessInfoSummaryPassPlay": "Local 2-Player • Unrated (No ELO/Score)",
  "chessInfoSummaryFindMatch": "Ranked Random 1v1 • Dynamic ELO Matchmaking",
  "chessInfoSummaryOnline": "Friend Room 1v1 • Unrated (Anti-Cheat)",
  "chessInfoSummaryPractice": "Practice Mode • Unrated (No ELO/Score)",
  "chessInfoDetailVsAi": "• Opponent Strength: AI Level {level} (Rating {rating}).\n• Chess ELO & Leaderboard: Wins, draws, and losses update your Chess ELO (K=32 formula). Your ELO delta is saved as score, and wins appear on the Leaderboard plus grant +{xp} XP.\n• Level Unlocks: Winning PRO unlocks Nightmare, and winning Nightmare unlocks Are U a God?.",
  "@chessInfoDetailVsAi": {
    "placeholders": {
      "level": {
        "type": "String"
      },
      "rating": {
        "type": "String"
      },
      "xp": {
        "type": "String"
      }
    }
  },
  "chessInfoDetailPassPlay": "• How to Play: Take turns playing White and Black on this same device — hand the device over after each move.\n• Score & ELO: Treated as a casual local match (same as Practice Mode). It does NOT change Chess ELO, does NOT save to Leaderboard, and does NOT award XP or unlock levels.",
  "chessInfoDetailFindMatch": "• Fair Random Matchmaking: Matches you against another live player queued in the same Timed control (Bullet, Blitz, or Rapid).\n• Expanding ELO Window: Starts searching near your ELO (±50) and widens automatically over time (±120 → ±250 → ±500 → ±1000). After 45s, it opens to the nearest online player (400–3500) even if the ELO gap is hundreds or thousands of points.\n• Anti-Cheat Protection: Colors are assigned randomly, self-matching is blocked, resigns/abandons before 4 half-moves are Aborted (0 ELO), ELO updates use the matched opponent rating (K=32), and AI Nightmare/God levels only unlock in Vs AI.",
  "chessInfoDetailOnline": "• Concept: Private 1v1 room via Supabase Realtime for playing with friends.\n• Host & Join: Sign in first. Host picks side & Time Control then shares the 6-character code; friend enters the code to join.\n• Anti-Cheat & Unrated Rule: Private Room matches are strictly Unrated — no Chess ELO change, no PRO+ Leaderboard entry, no XP, and no Nightmare/God level unlock so private rooms cannot be used for win-trading.",
